# P12 W1-C (docs/phase12-brief.md Q13, 9 "-clocks-one"): Extras > Clocks
# with its one clock, the home city (New York, the default): no header, the
# blue city band (city left, a light face by day, "15:05" over "Today"
# right), the world map under it (the panel's map is its right half);
# MENU comes back to the Extras list. Compare: owner photo clocks.jpg
# (photo 1193; Boston, same zone).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-mod scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-clocks-one.script
# needs: modules
# reset: clocks
# modclass: steady
# log: clocks open n=1
# nolog: clocks save
# reset: mainmenu

wait 4000            # boot to the main menu
sim_clock 15:05      # the panels' time (Tuesday 6 October 2026)
wheel +2             # Extras
wait 1500
key SELECT
wait 2500            # the Extras list, Clocks selected, its panel
shot extras_clocks
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot clocks_one
wheel +2             # one clock: nothing moves
wait 600
shot clocks_one_wheel
key MENU
wait 1500
shot back_to_extras
quit
